  "name": "Zendesk Chat",
  "label": "Zendesk Chat — Zendesk Sunshine Conversations API",
  "description": "Zendesk Chat via the official Zendesk Sunshine Conversations API. Base https://api.smooch.io/v2. Docs: https://developer.zendesk.com/api-reference/conversations/introduction/. This is Zendesk Messaging / Sunshine Conversations — not the Support ticketing API (other category). The Zendesk Chat product sunsets 2028-01-31 (announced 2026-08-04: https://support.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/articles/4408843026714). Legacy Chat REST is retired; this host is api.smooch.io/v2. listen = webhooks as BPMN message events. Handler: OfficialApiNode (api_spec.json). OUTPUT is {status,http_status,data} or {error}. Inbound provider events are BPMN message events (operation listen), not a Webhook node.",
  "icon": "support_agent",
  "tags": [
    "chat"
  ],
  "category": "Communication & Messaging",
